  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Net induced charge on sphere is zero so its potential at its own centre will be zero.<br /><br />V<sub>0</sub> = potential due to charges placed at eight corners<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>V</mtext><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>8Kq</mtext><mrow><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><msub><mtext>V</mtext><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>16Kq</mtext><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext>&#160;a</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math>",
